	"enemy-reinforcements-arrived": "Enemy reinforcements have arrived.",
	"Game-Faction-Atreides-Desc": "House Atreides The noble Atreides, from the water world of Caladan, rely on their Ornithopters to ensure air superiority. They have allied themselves with the Fremen, the fearsome native warriors of Dune who can move undetected in battle. Faction Variations: - Combat Tanks are balanced in terms of speed and durability Special Units: - Grenadier - Fremen - Sonic Tank Superweapon: - Airstrike",
	"Game-Faction-Atreides-Name": "Atreides",
	"Game-Faction-Corrino-Name": "Corrino",
	"Game-Faction-Fremen-Name": "Fremen ## defaults.yaml",
	"Game-Faction-Harkonnen-Desc": "House Harkonnen The evil Harkonnen will stop at nothing to gain control of the spice. They rely on brute force and atomic weapons to achieve their goals: wealth, and the destruction of House Atreides. Faction Variations: - Combat Tanks are more durable but move at a slower speed Special Units: - Sardaukar - Devastator Superweapon: - Death Hand Missile",
	"Game-Faction-Harkonnen-Name": "Harkonnen",
	"Game-Faction-Mercenaries-Name": "Mercenaries",
	"Game-Faction-Ordos-Desc": "House Ordos From the icy world of Sigma Draconis IV, the insidious Ordos are known for their wealth, greed, and treachery. They often turn to mercenaries, sabotage, and forbidden Ixian technologies to gain the upper hand. Faction Variations: - Trikes are replaced by Raider Trikes - Combat Tanks are faster but less durable Special Units: - Raider Trike - Stealth Raider Trike - Saboteur - Deviator",
	"Game-Faction-Ordos-Name": "Ordos",
